#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0041 expect=violation domain=CM
#note "No CMPRESP at all: not var_exists(\"--PRESP\") is TRUE dataset-wide (unsolicited domain). Row 1: OCCUR populated -> FIRES. Row 2: OCCUR empty -> clean. Mixed broadcast+row shape: the presence arm folds dataset-constant, the not-empty lead selects rows -> per-row findings."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 CMSEQ=1
dataset CM class=INTERVENTIONS label="Concomitant Medications"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col CMSEQ    type=Num
col CMTRT    type=Char
col CMOCCUR  type=Char
---
S1 | CM | 001 | 1 | ASPIRIN   | Y
S1 | CM | 001 | 2 | IBUPROFEN |
---
